        "title": "届: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "届 counts recurring sessions, terms and graduating classes. Ordinal 第 + number + 届 names a particular session.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这是第三届比赛。",
                "pinyin": "zhè shì dì sān jiè bǐsài 。",
                "meaning": "This is the third edition of the competition.",
                "audio": "65d473a7366b21fa8c0ba2c20138c363c34b7aba1c4f183d8644023f0118d5a5"
              },
              {
                "text": "他是上一届的学生。",
                "pinyin": "tā shì shàng yī jiè de xuéshēng 。",
                "meaning": "He is a student from the previous cohort.",
